    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After arriving in Brighthaven, you inherit your late uncle\u2019s failed delivery business. With nothing left but empty warehouses, you re-imagine the space, turning it into a chain of <strong>Rage Rooms</strong> where people smash objects to release stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, manage, and grow</strong> your destruction therapy empire. Hire staff, upgrade rooms, and help the world break free, one shattered plate at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become an outstanding manager:</strong> Recruit a team, manage salaries and skills to optimize the operation of your rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your demolition empire:</strong> Invest your profits to expand your premises, unlock new themed rooms, and ever more surprising objects to destr1oy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy at the heart of chaos:</strong> Manage your finances, launch marketing campaigns, and make crucial decisions to attract a diverse clientele and make your business prosper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced customization:</strong> Design your &quot;Rage Rooms&quot; to meet your customers' desires, maximize their satisfaction... and your revenue!</p></li></ul>",
